{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>המה כרעו</b> — corresponding to the men of the chariot." "<b>ונפלו</b> — corresponding to the men of the horses, as in 'his rider fell backward' [Exodus 15:1]." "<b>ואנחנו קמנו</b> — from the same root as: 'and the house arose' [1 Kings 13:12]." "<b>ונתעודד</b> — and we are exalted and uplifted, for מעודד is the opposite of משפיל."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:27:59.557205865Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}